{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0JvbGx5d29vZC8yMDAxLS0yMDEwL0RhYXllbiUyMFlhJTIwQmFheWVuJTIwJTI4MjAxMCUyOS8","type":"movie","name":"Daayen Ya Baayen","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/vsB9BF8KiUA5fTdGUXMZOKaCktd.jpg","description":"DAAYEN YA BAAYEN revolves around a schoolteacher in a remote village in the Himalayas who wins a luxury car in a TV contest. His life spirals in a series of comic conflicts as he tries to match the rest of his life to the glamour of the car, undoing himself completely in the process. When the car is stolen, he sets out on a journey to recover more than just his prized vehicle - his lost dignity.","releaseInfo":"2010","genres":["Family","Comedy","Drama","Bollywood"],"imdbRating":"7.8","runtime":"115 min","cast":["Deepak Dobriyal","Badrul Islam","Bharti Bhatt","Pratyush Sharma","Girish Tiwari","Jeetendra Bisht","Dhanuli Devi","Aarti Dhami"],"director":["Bela Negi"],"released":"2010-10-29T00:00:00.000Z","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Deepak Dobriyal","character":"Ramesh Majita","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/cImSPlrxucfiGS3ICvpFD5XSs64.jpg"},{"name":"Badrul Islam","character":"Basant"},{"name":"Bharti Bhatt","character":"Hema R. Majita"},{"name":"Pratyush Sharma","character":"Baju R. Majita"},{"name":"Girish Tiwari","character":"School Principal"},{"name":"Jeetendra Bisht","character":"Jwar Singh"},{"name":"Dhanuli Devi","character":"Mrs. Majita / Amma"},{"name":"Aarti Dhami","character":"Deepa"},{"name":"Dhananjay Shah","character":"Hema's brother"},{"name":"Manav Kaul","character":"Sundar","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/xzb8QK85p7jqJaTqaTJORW6QLXj.jpg"}]}}}